%N A393491 Multiplicative sequence a(n) with a(p^e) = floor((e+1)/3) for prime p and e > 0.
%H A393491 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A393491/b393491.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..65537</a>
%H A393491 <a href="/index/Eu#epf">Index entries for sequences computed from exponents in factorization of n</a>.
%F A393491 Dirichlet g.f.: zeta(2*s) * zeta(3*s) * zeta(5*s) / zeta(10*s).
%t A393491 f[p_, e_] := Floor[(e+1)/3]; a[1] = 1; a[n_] := Times @@ f @@@ FactorInteger[n]; Array[a, 100] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Feb 16 2026 *)
%o A393491 (PARI) a(n) = factorback(apply(e->floor((e+1)/3),factor(n)[, 2]))
%K A393491 nonn,easy,mult,changed
%O A393491 1,32
%A A393491 _Werner Schulte_, Feb 16 2026
